00:00:05.216 --> 00:00:09.749
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU HEAR A LOT ABOUT

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.576
SYSTEMIC RACISM IN AMERICA.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:13.679
IF YOU DON’T AGREE, YOU ARE

00:00:13.681 --> 00:00:14.891
PROOF OF THE PROBLEM.

00:00:14.892 --> 00:00:16.597
IT’S AN ACCUSATION THAT PREVENTS

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.589
YOU FROM MOUNTING A DEFENSE,

00:00:18.591 --> 00:00:21.790
WHICH LEADS TO ACTUAL SYSTEMIC

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:24.041
RACISM IN OUR EDUCATION SYSTEM,

00:00:24.042 --> 00:00:26.254
AS A PRETENSE TO ERADICATE IT.

00:00:26.255 --> 00:00:28.260
ONE NEW YORK CITY SCHOOL HAS

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.358
ASKED PARENTS TO RANK THEIR

00:00:30.359 --> 00:00:31.988
WHITENESS, FROM WHITE SUPREMACY

00:00:31.989 --> 00:00:33.328
TO WHITE ABOLITIONIST.

00:00:33.362 --> 00:00:36.158
HOW IS THAT NOT SYSTEMIC RACISM?

00:00:36.192 --> 00:00:37.834
IF YOU DISAGREE, AREN’T YOU

00:00:37.869 --> 00:00:38.682
PROOF OF THE PROBLEM?

00:00:38.683 --> 00:00:40.254
THE OREGON DEPARTMENT OF

00:00:40.289 --> 00:00:41.424
EDUCATION CONCLUDED THAT ASKING

00:00:41.425 --> 00:00:43.393
STUDENTS TO SHOW THEIR WORK IN

00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:45.503
MATH CLASS IS EVIDENCE OF WHITE

00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:45.872
SUPREMACY.

00:00:45.874 --> 00:00:48.787
THIS WOULD BE LAUGHABLE IF IT

00:00:48.789 --> 00:00:50.589
WEREN’T SO DAMAGING.

00:00:50.624 --> 00:00:52.309
ON A GLOBAL MATH RANKINGS,

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:53.133
AMERICA’S 25TH.

00:00:53.134 --> 00:00:54.970
WHO’S ON TOP OF READING,

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:55.962
SCIENCE, AND MATH?

00:00:55.963 --> 00:00:57.786
IT RHYMES WITH CHINA.

00:00:57.787 --> 00:00:59.324
INSTEAD OF LESSONS IN SOMETHING

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:00.589
THAT MATTERS, WE LET THESE

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:02.132
GOBBLE UP OUR KIDS.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.417
THEN THERE’S THE TEACHERS WHO

00:01:03.418 --> 00:01:06.443
PROBABLY NEVER READ SHAKESPEARE,

00:01:06.445 --> 00:01:08.007
DEMANDING THEY CUT HIM FROM

00:01:08.009 --> 00:01:11.943
COURSES, BECAUSE HE IS A TOOL OF

00:01:11.945 --> 00:01:12.525
WHITE OPPRESSION.

00:01:12.559 --> 00:01:14.546
REMEMBER THAT SAN FRANCISCO

00:01:14.581 --> 00:01:17.134
SCHOOL BOARD WANTED TO RENAME

00:01:17.135 --> 00:01:18.591
THOSE SCHOOLS?

00:01:18.593 --> 00:01:20.731
WE LAUGHED, BUT THEY WERE

00:01:20.765 --> 00:01:21.259
SERIOUS.

00:01:21.293 --> 00:01:23.387
THEY DELAYED IT REOPENING

00:01:23.421 --> 00:01:26.142
CLASSROOMS TO TACKLE THIS

00:01:26.177 --> 00:01:26.913
PRIORITY.

00:01:26.914 --> 00:01:29.498
THIS HAS BECOME THE NEW

00:01:29.499 --> 00:01:29.818
CURRICULUM.

00:01:29.819 --> 00:01:31.270
RACE WARFARE USING IDENTITY

00:01:31.271 --> 00:01:33.639
POLITICS TO GIVE POWER TO A

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:37.034
CLICK OF PETTY DICTATORS.

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:39.143
IT’S BRAINWASHING AND WASHES

00:01:39.144 --> 00:01:39.956
AWAY THE BRAINS.

00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:41.715
THEY ARE SPENDING YOUR TAX

00:01:41.716 --> 00:01:45.354
DOLLARS TO MAKE YOUR KID DUMBER.

00:01:45.356 --> 00:01:47.691
CNN CAN DO THAT FOR FREE.

00:01:47.725 --> 00:01:49.126
WE WERE TALKING ABOUT THE SCHOOL

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.150
BOARD, AND WE THOUGHT THEY ARE

00:01:51.151 --> 00:01:54.078
MARGINAL, WON’T HAVE AN IMPACT.

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:56.215
THEY’RE GOING TO DELAY

00:01:56.217 --> 00:01:58.519
DISCUSSING PUTTING KIDS BACK IN

00:01:58.553 --> 00:02:02.579
CLASS, AND TACKLED THE NAME

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.224
CHANGE FIRST.

00:02:03.225 --> 00:02:04.733
&gt;&gt; Juan: I DON’T THINK THAT’S

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:05.123
RIGHT.

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:07.305
