00:02:07.306 --> 00:02:10.150
IT’S ABOUT GETTING KIDS BACK IN

00:02:10.151 --> 00:02:12.044
SCHOOL FIRST AND FOREMOST.

00:02:12.045 --> 00:02:13.871
