00:02:17.591 --> 00:02:18.826
MOST OF THE COUNTRY.

00:02:18.827 --> 00:02:20.803
TO YOUR LARGER POINT, I THINK WE

00:02:20.804 --> 00:02:22.653
ARE MORE DIVERSE THAN EVER.

00:02:22.654 --> 00:02:24.869
YOU SEE RISING NUMBERS OF

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.693
MINORITIES, ESPECIALLY

00:02:26.694 --> 00:02:28.755
HISPANICS, ASIANS IN AMERICAN

00:02:28.789 --> 00:02:29.201
SOCIETY.

00:02:29.202 --> 00:02:31.258
WITH THAT COMES PEOPLE WHO

00:02:31.292 --> 00:02:32.374
DIDN’T HAVE A VOICE BEFORE,

00:02:32.408 --> 00:02:35.421
