00:02:40.697 --> 00:02:41.887
TO BE MORE AWARE OF HOW THEY

00:02:41.888 --> 00:02:44.446
TREAT THE PEOPLE WHO ARE NOT

00:02:44.447 --> 00:02:45.702
WHITE IN THIS SOCIETY.

00:02:45.704 --> 00:02:49.437
TO ASK THEM TO THINK ABOUT HOW
THEY DEAL WITH THE OTHER.

00:02:49.438 --> 00:02:51.264
THEY DEAL WITH THE OTHER.

00:02:51.265 --> 00:02:54.916
I DON’T THINK "RACIST."

00:02:54.918 --> 00:02:57.964
RIGHT NOW, THERE’S A LOT OF

00:02:57.998 --> 00:03:01.456
