00:03:06.323 --> 00:03:08.441
LOOKING FORWARD, TAKING A STEP

00:03:08.475 --> 00:03:10.280
IN TERMS OF TRYING TO MAKE SURE

00:03:10.282 --> 00:03:12.485
THAT WE ARE TREATED EQUALLY.

00:03:12.486 --> 00:03:14.206
I DON’T THINK THAT’S A BAD THING

00:03:14.207 --> 00:03:14.389
THING.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.779
&gt;&gt; Greg: I THINK YOU MIGHT BE

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.816
